94_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UoLeHfSF5gcQ7kNvwG6Sy9y&_nc_oc=Adrgq9EPsvca_KhB-JKJaWsln3l8QGxZZb668gsxMmNpD9C46AGzrvUDVQabK0pnQY4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRsGjMRMAv80NUCqkYOQ7O-hpLWk3W4YKyEgIn_RVqwaA&oe=6AFB3438"}, {"file_name": "screen4.png", "id": "1658166027932438", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75241698_1658166031265771_1482428283944475893_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jU53n1XVMrsQ7kNvwETEcfi&_nc_oc=AdouvRVlbCgAhdPooHOiLb-y_k6ipCAwhwaYSoIgs0MTYTOUuNaV9xaJjonD6fPwUJQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTXp8AuP-NsrxHr4_V1TuhIgDf_T9E8NGUMPW0XMtnAdg&oe=6AFB35F1"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Graphics Showcase", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This application is a technical demo intended for Quest developers using Unreal Engine 5. \n\nTone mapping is an important artistic tool for developers. Graphics Showcase features a Vulkan subpass-based tone mapping solution that is much more performant than traditional techniques.\n\nPress B to cycle through these effects:\n- Day / Night cycle\n- Sepia LUT\n- Reddish LUT\n\nPress A to toggle tonemap subpass off / on\n\nPress Right Trigger to toggle FFR off / high\n\nPress Right Grip to toggle MSAA 1/2/4", "short_description": "This application is a technical demo intended for Quest developers using Unreal Engine 5. \n\nTone mapping is an important artistic tool for developers. Graphics Showcase features a Vulkan subpass-based tone mapping solution that is much more performant than traditional techniques. \n\nPress B to cycle through these effects:\n- Day / Night cycle\n- Sepia LUT\n- Reddish LUT\n\nPress A to toggle tonemap subpass off / on\n\nPress Right Trigger to toggle FFR off / high\n\nPress Right Grip to toggle MSAA 1/2/4"}]}, "developer_name": "Oculus Samples", "developer_privac